WEBVTT

00:07.000 --> 00:09.000
[♪ suspenseful music]

00:11.460 --> 00:12.670
[grunts]

00:12.760 --> 00:13.840
A gun?

00:14.430 --> 00:15.430
Kisaki!

00:16.800 --> 00:17.930
Hanagaki.

00:18.850 --> 00:20.180
Takemitchy.

00:20.270 --> 00:22.890
[groaning]

00:22.980 --> 00:24.440
[grunts]

00:25.770 --> 00:27.810
Hey! What the hell are you doing?

00:28.440 --> 00:29.770
This is just a kids' fight!

00:33.610 --> 00:35.280
[breathes deeply]

00:38.740 --> 00:43.330
[Takemichi] <i>The situation is pretty dire,
but for some reason,</i>

00:44.660 --> 00:45.870
<i>I'm not afraid.</i>

00:47.960 --> 00:49.790
Please cooperate with me.

00:49.880 --> 00:53.010
I am proud of you.

00:53.670 --> 00:54.970
[Takemichi] <i>Naoto...</i>

00:56.300 --> 00:58.260
<i>Thank you for showing me the way.</i>

00:59.760 --> 01:02.270
I leave Mikey and Toman

01:03.310 --> 01:05.100
in your hands.

01:05.730 --> 01:06.810
[Takemichi] <i>Baji.</i>

01:07.900 --> 01:11.520
Take care of Toman for me, partner.

01:12.150 --> 01:13.280
[Takemichi] <i>Chifuyu.</i>

01:15.490 --> 01:17.610
<i>All your hopes are giving me courage.</i>

01:20.910 --> 01:22.160
<i>That's why...</i>

01:24.290 --> 01:26.080
<i>I've got nothing to fear.</i>

01:28.540 --> 01:32.000
Kisaki, what are you so afraid of?

01:32.090 --> 01:33.630
[gasps]

01:36.550 --> 01:38.640
[gunshot]

01:40.010 --> 01:42.100
[♪ theme music]

03:07.140 --> 03:09.890
TOKYO REVENGERS

03:16.900 --> 03:19.690
[all gasp]

03:22.740 --> 03:25.870
[Kisaki pants]

03:29.200 --> 03:31.870
[Takemichi groans softly]

03:35.380 --> 03:38.090
[Takemichi] What's the matter, Kisaki?

03:39.590 --> 03:43.050
Shooting me in the foot won't kill me.

03:43.550 --> 03:46.550
[pants]

03:49.180 --> 03:50.390
[Takemichi groans softly]

03:52.440 --> 03:54.940
<i>I've got lots of reasons why I can't lose.</i>

03:56.940 --> 03:59.440
Quit looking at me that way.

04:00.530 --> 04:02.950
Let's take back our Toman.

04:03.610 --> 04:07.410
I admired how you stood your ground
even while crying.

04:07.490 --> 04:11.540
[Mitsuya] <i>That's why I wanted to be
the one to make your uniform.</i>

04:13.620 --> 04:15.880
[♪ somber music]

04:18.040 --> 04:19.920
[groaning]

04:20.000 --> 04:22.010
[breathes heavily]

04:23.680 --> 04:27.800
I'm not charismatic like Mikey.

04:27.890 --> 04:29.510
[gasps]

04:30.680 --> 04:33.230
And I'm not smart like Naoto.

04:34.440 --> 04:36.440
What the hell are you babbling about?

04:36.810 --> 04:39.230
And I'm not shrewd like Koko.

04:40.320 --> 04:42.860
And I'm not big and strong like Mucho.

04:45.570 --> 04:47.570
[groans]

04:49.080 --> 04:52.660
And I'm not a good fighter like Draken.

04:54.330 --> 04:56.580
[breathes heavily] So...

04:57.920 --> 04:59.960
there's only one thing...

05:01.920 --> 05:02.920
I can do!

05:03.010 --> 05:05.800
[panting]

05:10.850 --> 05:12.060
Never give up.

05:15.310 --> 05:18.100
I will never give up, even if it kills me!

05:18.190 --> 05:21.190
[crackles]

05:22.860 --> 05:25.740
[breathes rapidly]

05:31.450 --> 05:32.870
I'll kill you.

05:36.870 --> 05:38.080
[soft grunts]

05:39.540 --> 05:40.710
Then do it.

05:42.340 --> 05:44.090
-[Mucho] <i>This guy...</i>
-[Koko] <i>This guy...</i>

05:44.920 --> 05:46.170
It's easy, right?

05:47.130 --> 05:48.340
[crackles]

05:49.970 --> 05:52.060
Just like when you killed Emma.

05:55.390 --> 05:58.560
[breathes heavily]

06:03.820 --> 06:05.030
Huh?

06:07.570 --> 06:08.990
[grunts]

06:09.490 --> 06:11.200
[groans]

06:12.780 --> 06:15.910
[Takemichi] <i>Damn it! I can't move!</i>

06:23.000 --> 06:24.000
Akkun...

06:26.880 --> 06:27.880
What's wrong?

06:28.260 --> 06:31.390
Isn't not knowing when to give up
your only redeeming point?

06:31.470 --> 06:32.640
[gasps]

06:34.060 --> 06:38.310
[Peh-yan] "As long as I am here,
Toman will not lose," huh?

06:39.390 --> 06:42.900
You aren't strong enough alone, dumbass!

06:43.520 --> 06:44.650
Peh-yan.

06:45.440 --> 06:48.530
Even though you're not strong enough,
it hit me here.

06:48.900 --> 06:50.990
I can't just lie around.

06:51.070 --> 06:52.700
You've hyped me up.

06:53.780 --> 06:54.780
Guys...

06:55.280 --> 06:57.500
-[Chifuyu] Takemitchy.
-[soft grunts]

06:58.370 --> 07:02.500
I'm glad it was you
who took over for Baji.

07:04.880 --> 07:05.960
<i>Chifuyu...</i>

07:11.380 --> 07:12.390
Kisaki.

07:13.680 --> 07:17.060
I want to kill you for murdering Baji.

07:18.770 --> 07:19.850
But

07:20.560 --> 07:22.440
this is just a kids' fight.

07:23.060 --> 07:24.610
We're not here to kill.

07:25.110 --> 07:26.570
[scoffs]

07:27.650 --> 07:29.940
We just want to show off.

07:30.530 --> 07:32.990
To be all badass and cocky.

07:33.070 --> 07:36.160
Since we've got no outlet
to display our power, we fight!

07:37.030 --> 07:39.410
We fight with our fists!

07:39.950 --> 07:41.910
For what we believe in!

07:42.420 --> 07:43.790
For the burdens we bear!

07:48.090 --> 07:49.760
[irked grunt]

07:50.550 --> 07:52.180
[exhales deeply]

07:58.180 --> 08:01.850
[Mucho] <i>This is what sets
Tenjiku and Toman apart.</i>

08:03.140 --> 08:06.440
<i>We just wanted to make you...</i>

08:07.820 --> 08:08.820
<i>Izana,</i>

08:09.440 --> 08:12.950
<i>what the hell are we even striving for?</i>

08:16.030 --> 08:17.030
So?

08:18.660 --> 08:22.540
[Kisaki] You trash can get up
and make flowery speeches all you like.

08:22.620 --> 08:24.710
It doesn't change the fact you'll lose!

08:26.380 --> 08:29.130
Are you sure you want Toman to disappear,

08:29.590 --> 08:30.710
Takemitchy?

08:33.550 --> 08:36.090
How dare you casually use my nickname.

08:36.180 --> 08:38.760
You guys are a real pain in the ass.

08:39.310 --> 08:41.560
Fine. I'll give in.

08:41.930 --> 08:43.350
Let's compromise.

08:43.430 --> 08:45.520
We'll merge Toman and Tenjiku.

08:45.900 --> 08:48.230
Neither one commands the other.

08:48.770 --> 08:51.190
The gang's name will be Tokyo Manji Gang.

08:51.650 --> 08:53.530
Mikey can be the leader.

08:53.610 --> 08:54.900
How about it?

08:54.990 --> 08:56.950
Not a bad proposal, huh?

08:57.910 --> 08:59.490
[exhales deeply]

09:00.540 --> 09:02.790
[both grunt]

09:05.960 --> 09:08.170
[groaning]

09:09.670 --> 09:11.300
-[Takemichi] Kisaki.
-[groans]

09:12.130 --> 09:13.970
I'm going to beat some sense

09:15.130 --> 09:16.590
into that rotten brain of yours.

09:19.140 --> 09:20.260
Get up, Kisaki.

09:22.220 --> 09:25.270
That's how things ended up in the future.

09:25.770 --> 09:27.140
[grunts]

09:28.440 --> 09:30.690
I'm in no mood for a compromise.

09:31.480 --> 09:35.320
Why the heck are you
so damn obstinate with me?

09:35.400 --> 09:36.530
Shut up!

09:36.610 --> 09:40.370
You could kill Emma so easily,
but you can't kill me?

09:42.950 --> 09:46.830
Why would someone like Draken
murder someone?

09:47.870 --> 09:49.460
I couldn't understand it.

09:50.960 --> 09:54.670
[Draken] If I could live my life
over again,

09:54.760 --> 09:57.630
there's one thing I'd absolutely do.

09:57.720 --> 09:59.720
[inhales deeply]

10:00.300 --> 10:02.220
I'd kill Kisaki!

10:04.310 --> 10:05.890
That's what he said in the future.

10:08.440 --> 10:11.230
You're not making any sense at all.

10:14.190 --> 10:15.230
Kisaki wants to

10:16.440 --> 10:20.030
take away everything
that Mikey holds dear.

10:20.410 --> 10:23.410
Tell Draken this for me.

10:24.450 --> 10:27.750
"Ken, I love you."

10:28.790 --> 10:30.210
My life was

10:31.210 --> 10:33.090
nothing but suffering.

10:33.630 --> 10:35.500
Take care of...

10:36.420 --> 10:38.880
Mikey for me, okay?

10:41.010 --> 10:42.220
[Takemichi] Draken...

10:42.760 --> 10:43.760
Mikey...

10:45.470 --> 10:46.470
<i>Emma!</i>

10:49.060 --> 10:52.230
[yells]

10:53.650 --> 10:55.440
Out of my way, Izana!

10:55.900 --> 10:57.030
Stand aside, Kisaki.

10:59.200 --> 11:02.070
Get rid of anyone
who gets in the way, right?

11:02.160 --> 11:04.030
[Takemichi groans]

11:08.080 --> 11:10.830
[panting]

11:15.960 --> 11:17.420
Every last one of them...

11:18.420 --> 11:20.090
I'll kill them all.

11:22.720 --> 11:25.140
[Takemichi continues panting]

11:32.850 --> 11:34.310
Every last one of them...

11:35.310 --> 11:36.980
I'll kill them all.

11:37.780 --> 11:39.900
[all gasp]

11:39.990 --> 11:42.860
[wheezing]

11:44.530 --> 11:46.450
I won't let you,

11:46.530 --> 11:47.740
bastard!

11:50.540 --> 11:51.750
Don't get cocky, scum.

11:52.460 --> 11:54.750
[♪ action music]

11:58.800 --> 12:00.460
[grunts]

12:02.510 --> 12:03.590
I finally understand...

12:04.340 --> 12:07.050
what you meant, Draken.

12:12.690 --> 12:14.900
[Takemichi] <i>You ended up on death row</i>

12:15.440 --> 12:17.980
<i>because you went to avenge Emma's death.</i>

12:18.070 --> 12:20.070
[Takemichi yelling]

12:26.410 --> 12:28.780
[groans in pain]

12:38.380 --> 12:39.960
[all grunt]

12:40.050 --> 12:42.630
[grunting]

12:48.300 --> 12:50.140
[Takemichi] <i>You had a real reason to!</i>

12:50.220 --> 12:52.770
[breathes heavily]

12:53.640 --> 12:56.190
Don't get up, Takemichi.

12:56.270 --> 12:58.150
[sighs]

12:58.230 --> 13:00.320
[panting]

13:02.610 --> 13:05.200
[Takemichi]
<i>Mikey ended up like that in the future</i>

13:06.910 --> 13:08.570
<i>for a real reason.</i>

13:10.410 --> 13:14.080
You bastards drove Mikey over the edge.

13:18.380 --> 13:21.590
Punch me until you're satisfied, Izana.

13:28.180 --> 13:30.100
Goddamn tenacious bastard.

13:30.850 --> 13:32.220
I will...

13:33.220 --> 13:35.230
I will protect...

13:38.480 --> 13:41.900
[groaning, retching]

13:41.980 --> 13:44.440
[grunting]

13:45.240 --> 13:46.740
That's enough, Izana!

13:48.240 --> 13:49.530
[Takemichi groans]

13:53.910 --> 13:57.250
[gasping]

14:01.840 --> 14:04.380
[Takemichi] I will... protect...

14:05.340 --> 14:09.090
Toman... and Mikey.

14:10.680 --> 14:11.800
I will

14:12.510 --> 14:14.430
protect them!

14:22.900 --> 14:23.900
[Izana] Hm?

14:24.320 --> 14:25.360
[Kakucho] <i>He stopped?</i>

14:25.730 --> 14:27.360
[all gasp]

14:28.400 --> 14:30.070
[Mucho] <i>He must have burned out.</i>

14:30.160 --> 14:31.450
[sighs]

14:33.910 --> 14:35.370
[Takemichi] You're late.

14:36.870 --> 14:38.790
[groans]

14:53.220 --> 14:56.310
I didn't lose.

14:59.350 --> 15:00.350
Huh?

15:00.980 --> 15:02.310
What are you saying?

15:02.400 --> 15:03.900
[gasps]

15:06.360 --> 15:07.480
[Hakkai] <i>Can it be?</i>

15:08.190 --> 15:10.070
[breathes deeply]

15:11.990 --> 15:15.240
[all gasp]

15:17.700 --> 15:18.950
[soft grunts]

15:20.460 --> 15:21.710
Leader!

15:30.010 --> 15:31.010
No way!

15:31.800 --> 15:32.970
For real?

15:33.050 --> 15:34.090
But why?

15:34.180 --> 15:35.550
Mikey...

15:36.140 --> 15:37.560
[crackles]

15:37.640 --> 15:40.810
How... But how?

15:42.140 --> 15:44.770
[Koko]
He just lost his little sister today.

15:45.190 --> 15:47.320
He should be wallowing in despair.

15:48.690 --> 15:50.570
There's no way he could've come.

15:50.650 --> 15:53.410
[♪ action music]

15:56.160 --> 15:59.540
Let me talk to Takemitchy for a second.

16:04.170 --> 16:05.830
You came.

16:10.970 --> 16:13.260
Thank you, Takemitchy.

16:15.640 --> 16:16.680
Mikey...

16:18.350 --> 16:19.890
But why?

16:20.430 --> 16:22.060
You were in no condition to...

16:23.690 --> 16:26.110
[motorcycle engine rumbles]

16:32.900 --> 16:34.280
[Takemichi] Draken!

16:36.160 --> 16:38.330
Why are both of you here?

16:39.160 --> 16:40.450
Get off,

16:40.950 --> 16:42.040
Hina.

16:44.290 --> 16:45.420
What?

16:52.090 --> 16:53.130
[Hina] Um...

16:59.930 --> 17:03.520
Can I... talk to you for a moment?

17:06.560 --> 17:08.190
[Hina breathes shakily]

17:08.770 --> 17:09.900
Hm.

17:10.860 --> 17:11.900
[Hina] Takemichi...

17:13.530 --> 17:17.570
Takemichi thought he could save Emma.

17:18.570 --> 17:19.580
Hey!

17:19.660 --> 17:21.700
This is no time to talk about that!

17:21.790 --> 17:22.950
Have you lost your mind?

17:23.040 --> 17:25.250
[pants]

17:25.870 --> 17:27.500
It doesn't make any sense.

17:27.580 --> 17:30.380
Not just Takemitchy, but Hina too...

17:30.920 --> 17:33.420
Why would you talk like that
at a time like this?

17:35.670 --> 17:38.340
Just leave us alone.

17:41.890 --> 17:43.310
It's not just Emma.

17:44.100 --> 17:47.900
There are lots of people
that Takemichi believes he has to save.

17:48.690 --> 17:50.440
So? What about it?

17:50.900 --> 17:51.940
I...

17:52.480 --> 17:53.570
died.

17:56.360 --> 17:59.410
Twelve years in the future, I died.

17:59.490 --> 18:00.780
[gasps]

18:03.040 --> 18:08.250
Takemichi came from the future
to keep that from happening.

18:10.330 --> 18:12.170
I know it sounds unbelievable.

18:13.000 --> 18:14.380
But it's true.

18:17.590 --> 18:20.180
He's desperate.

18:21.260 --> 18:23.010
He knows all your futures. [sobbing]

18:24.770 --> 18:27.600
He wants to save all of you.

18:27.680 --> 18:29.190
[soft grunts]

18:29.270 --> 18:31.230
[♪ somber music]

18:40.860 --> 18:45.290
But I can't do anything to help him.

18:50.540 --> 18:51.580
[Hina] Sorry,

18:52.330 --> 18:53.460
Takemichi.

18:56.090 --> 18:57.130
I came.

19:03.470 --> 19:04.470
Huh?

19:05.640 --> 19:06.720
What?

19:06.810 --> 19:08.680
You told those two?

19:08.770 --> 19:10.230
Uh...

19:12.060 --> 19:13.480
Sorry. It slipped out.

19:13.980 --> 19:15.440
"It slipped out"?

19:16.860 --> 19:18.070
[Takemichi] <i>What now?</i>

19:19.530 --> 19:22.410
<i>Those two were in total despair.</i>

19:22.990 --> 19:24.910
<i>How can they possibly fight?</i>

19:26.700 --> 19:28.660
<i>I'm glad they came, but...</i>

19:30.960 --> 19:32.920
What will you do, Mikey?

19:33.330 --> 19:36.420
Looks like
about 200 of them can still fight.

19:37.630 --> 19:39.130
[Mikey] Two hundred, huh?

19:40.300 --> 19:41.680
And there's two of us.

19:42.510 --> 19:43.510
Yeah.

19:45.890 --> 19:47.060
You need a handicap?

19:47.140 --> 19:49.770
-[all grunting]
-A handicap?

19:51.060 --> 19:52.690
Screw you!

19:52.770 --> 19:54.400
You making a fool of us?

19:54.480 --> 19:56.150
That's our line, asshole!

19:56.230 --> 19:57.520
[all grunting]

19:57.610 --> 20:00.030
I think you're the ones
making a fool of us.

20:00.940 --> 20:02.780
Just who do you think I am?

20:04.660 --> 20:05.950
Two hundred guys?

20:10.250 --> 20:12.330
Bring me 20,000!

20:12.410 --> 20:14.580
[all grunt]

20:15.080 --> 20:16.290
Twenty thousand?

20:17.590 --> 20:18.710
Mikey!

20:21.340 --> 20:22.880
[Takemichi] <i>It's Mikey!</i>

20:23.260 --> 20:25.050
<i>It's the Mikey I always knew!</i>

20:26.180 --> 20:28.060
[sobbing]

20:29.060 --> 20:31.890
<i>The Mikey I always knew is back!</i>

20:33.810 --> 20:35.980
What's wrong, guys?

20:37.560 --> 20:40.150
Let's have fun. It's fighting time!

20:41.190 --> 20:43.450
Make some noise, Toman!

20:43.530 --> 20:46.070
-[Mikey] You're so loud, Draken.
-[all yelling]

20:47.870 --> 20:50.160
-[Takemichi] Thank you, Hina.
-[Hina] Huh?

20:51.160 --> 20:54.120
[Takemichi] I couldn't get those two
back on their feet again.

20:55.790 --> 20:59.750
But your sincere feelings moved those two.

21:02.590 --> 21:04.630
[Hina] You've got it all wrong, Takemichi.

21:05.970 --> 21:08.010
It takes more than feelings
to move people.

21:08.100 --> 21:09.100
Huh?

21:10.350 --> 21:14.230
[Hina] It was the sight of your tenacity
that moved them.

21:17.520 --> 21:18.860
Ah...

21:18.940 --> 21:20.980
My ears are starting to ring.

21:22.530 --> 21:25.110
I don't know what kind of trick they used,

21:26.240 --> 21:28.410
but our plan has gone off the rails,

21:28.820 --> 21:31.700
-Kisaki.
-[grunts]

21:42.090 --> 21:43.670
[gasps]

21:46.590 --> 21:48.590
-Mikey!
-He's fast!

21:48.680 --> 21:50.550
[both gasp]

21:53.470 --> 21:54.470
How's it feel

21:55.310 --> 21:57.060
to become an empty shell?

21:58.730 --> 22:01.570
Izana... Kurokawa.

22:02.610 --> 22:07.490
I'm asking you how it feels
to lose both Shinichiro and Emma,

22:07.570 --> 22:08.950
Manjiro Sano!

22:11.240 --> 22:14.200
Let's settle this, my brother.

22:16.000 --> 22:18.000
[♪ closing theme music]

23:44.710 --> 23:46.710
Translated by Brian Athey
